# Other agents' live working trees. Several coding agents run in this repo at once,
# each in its own git worktree, and six of those worktrees sit INSIDE this folder.
# The path is gitignored, so nothing an agent checks by default reveals that the files
# there belong to someone else — one of them routinely holds uncommitted work.
#
# Cursor feeds this file into its sandbox's filesystem rules, so listing the path here
# is a mechanism rather than a request. AGENTS.md § Hard lines explains the same
# boundary in prose for tools that have no equivalent.
/.claude/worktrees/
